  "D2_statement": "Conjecture D2 (Chebotarev along pure-even k-slices). Let f_m be an irreducible fibre on a multi-seed pure-even k-slice with Gal(f_m/Q)=A5. For unramified primes p, the Frobenius conjugacy class is equidistributed among conjugacy classes of A5 with natural densities equal to class sizes / |A5|. In particular, factorization type (3,1,1) occurs with density 20/60=1/3, type (5) with density 24/60=2/5, and type (2,2,1) with density 15/60=1/4.",
  "D2_status": "empirical_chebotarev_proxy",
